pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">신청 방법 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 32.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 183%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -9.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">●</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">참여 인원 모집</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 32.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 193%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -9.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">각 거점센터별 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">2~5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">팀 모집</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">지원팀은 재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">휴학생을 포함하여 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">2~5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함